.build/
# Build output. `just build-vision-plugin` stages the binary and its SwiftPM
# resource bundle here, in a directory that holds nothing else — the plugin
# root cannot hold the binary itself, because a directory holding an
# Info.plist beside an executable named after that directory IS a flat bundle
# to codesign, and AMFI then SIGKILLs it at spawn. See that recipe.
/dist/
